  "instructions": [
    "In a pressure cooker, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown.",
    "Add the malt syrup, vegetable broth, agar agar, lemon juice, thyme, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Close the pressure cooker and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally, then open the cooker and stir the mixture.",
    "Pour the mixture into a terrine mold and refrigerate until set.",
    "Slice the terrine and serve chilled."
  ],
